  "description": "Made to accelerate. Engineered for winning.\n\nZenith’s share the same proven low-profile geometry as the DK Professional frame providing max speed and stability. Available in six frame sizes including the Zenith Disc 24-inch cruiser. All matched with pro level componentry: BOX X5 carbon fiber forks, DUO Brand drivetrains, and Maxxis rubber.\n\nNOTE: The DK Zenith Disc frame is compatible with flat mount disc brakes only. Flat mount is more compact and lighter than post mount. With flat mount, the rear caliper affixed with two bolts running through a flattened frame surface and then threading directly into the caliper (or an adapter affixed to the caliper).\n\nCranks DUO Brand C2 forged hollow alloy 2-piece, 175mm\n\nBB European external (outboard)\n\nSprocket DUO Brand 44-tooth, CNC machined, alloy, 4-bolt chainring\n\nChain Taya TB980 3/32”\n\nPedals DUO Brand Resilite platform\n\nRims DUO Brand R2, double wall, 36-hole, front and rear specific design\n\nFront Hub DUO Brand R2, fully sealed, 20mm thru-axle\n\nRear Hub DUO Brand R2 Disc, fully sealed, 15mm thru-axle, 16-tooth cassette with 120 engagement points\n\nTires 20x1.75” (rear), 20x1.95” (front) Maxxis Torch\n\nSeat BOX Echelon 1-piece seat/post combo\n\nSeat Post Integrated, 27.2mm, alloy\n\nSeat Post Clamp Promax quick-release\n\nBMX RACE BIKE SIZE GUIDE",
